{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a fur trading empire</strong> in the rich, historical world of 18th-century North America<strong>.</strong> Start with a single, modest cabin and strategically expand your influence to <strong>amass a fortune</strong>. Your ambition is the only limit on the wild frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR NATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your enterprise as Canada, France, Great Britain, Netherlands, Russia, Spain, Sweden, or the United States\u2014each with <strong>unique strengths</strong>, <strong>historical advantages</strong>, and <strong>strategic challenges</strong>. Or, for a truly balanced experience, play as the neutral nation of Beaverland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FORGE ALLIANCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is home to hundreds of tribal nations. Your reputation is your <strong>most valuable asset</strong>, defined through key decisions. Supplying a tribe with weapons will strengthen your standing, while dealing in alcohol or arming their enemies will damage it. A high reputation increases the volume of goods a tribe will offer, while a poor reputation can see you shut out of their territory entirely, or even <strong>go to war</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A LIVING ECOSYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade in a world with a dynamic ecosystem based on historical migration patterns. Your choices have lasting consequences, forcing you to expand and adapt to an ever-changing landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A UNIQUE TRADING EXPERIENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Made Beaver</i> is a unique blend of <strong>deep economic strategy </strong>and <strong>rich historical simulation</strong>. While your goal is profit, your path is paved with history. Crafted by a solo developer committed to historical accuracy, every detail\u2014from trade routes and prices, to furs, tribes, and settlements\u2014is designed to create an authentic and challenging experience that <strong>you won't find in any other trading game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to carve your name into history? <strong>Launch your trading empire today</strong> and become the master of the fur trade!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Great Dominion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/a31f6d9f677de8cbd568b17b007711b801636959.jpg"},{"name":"The Voyageurs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/1c88cb71663103d4cfb7ae6e877dd2b9a5314687.jpg"},{"name":"God Save The King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/74fcb72a02c245b9e85b02d57d2bd9987d533f44.jpg"},{"name":"Land Of Plenty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/852f01eb41092621587cfd4797aefbbdc007e29c.jpg"},{"name":"For The Empire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/de0c7a8eaad70e161ebf3b9365294e866e01d4de.jpg"},{"name":"Glory Be","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/c4490be4147eb103ba7f44a738eaf9031a04eb04.jpg"},{"name":"Frihet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/a2f700278a49046f424c52e2f5727fc738a031ff.jpg"},{"name":"We The People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/6608e3219d5c7c308a47c36ea906f2fde8339bc6.jpg"},{"name":"The Diplomat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/39db6c0c368f8ff8f56fbc52e658435be9f91810.jpg"},{"name":"The Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980000/3b5086c288c3943fb04995e01b773ec09d813aab.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1980000?t=1752690012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752690012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752690012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752690012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a fur trading empire</strong> in the rich, historical world of 18th-century North America<strong>.</strong> Start with a single, modest cabin and strategically expand your influence to <strong>amass a fortune</strong>. Your ambition is the only limit on the wild frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR NATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your enterprise as Canada, France, Great Britain, Netherlands, Russia, Spain, Sweden, or the United States\u2014each with <strong>unique strengths</strong>, <strong>historical advantages</strong>, and <strong>strategic challenges</strong>. Or, for a truly balanced experience, play as the neutral nation of Beaverland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FORGE ALLIANCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is home to hundreds of tribal nations. Your reputation is your <strong>most valuable asset</strong>, defined through key decisions. Supplying a tribe with weapons will strengthen your standing, while dealing in alcohol or arming their enemies will damage it. A high reputation increases the volume of goods a tribe will offer, while a poor reputation can see you shut out of their territory entirely, or even <strong>go to war</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A LIVING ECOSYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade in a world with a dynamic ecosystem based on historical migration patterns. Your choices have lasting consequences, forcing you to expand and adapt to an ever-changing landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A UNIQUE TRADING EXPERIENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Made Beaver</i> is a unique blend of <strong>deep economic strategy </strong>and <strong>rich historical simulation</strong>. While your goal is profit, your path is paved with history. Crafted by a solo developer committed to historical accuracy, every detail\u2014from trade routes and prices, to furs, tribes, and settlements\u2014is designed to create an authentic and challenging experience that <strong>you won't find in any other trading game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to carve your name into history? <strong>Launch your trading empire today</strong> and become the master of the fur trade!</p>","developers":["Chiron Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980000/header.jpg?t=1752690012","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Chiron Games Inc. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1980000/1